# INVWIN1.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: Windows ends its
# session (Q) while the login dialog holds a typed password, which
# WM_ENDSESSION wipes: the snapshot after Q shows the password control
# empty.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN1.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
S TYPED
Q
S WIPED
